@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_PublicLayout.cshtml";
}

@section Styles {
    <style>
        .legal-page {
            padding: 6rem 0 3rem;
            background: var(--bg-soft);
        }

        .legal-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

            .legal-header h1 {
                font-size: 2.8rem;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--primary-dark);
                letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            }

        .last-updated {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 0.3rem;
        }

        .legal-body {
            max-width: 820px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 2.5rem 3rem;
            border-radius: var(--radius-card);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

            .legal-body h2 {
                font-size: 1.4rem;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: var(--primary-dark);
                margin-top: 1.8rem;
                margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
                padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
                border-bottom: 1px solid #E8EDF5;
            }

            .legal-body p {
                color: var(--text-muted);
                line-height: 1.8;
                margin-bottom: 1rem;
            }

            .legal-body ul {
                margin: 0.5rem 0 1.2rem 1.5rem;
            }

                .legal-body ul li {
                    color: var(--text-muted);
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
                }

            .legal-body a {
                color: var(--primary-bright);
                text-decoration: none;
            }

                .legal-body a:hover {
                    text-decoration: underline;
                }

        @@media (max-width: 768px) {
            .legal-body {
                padding: 1.8rem;
            }

            .legal-header h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
}

<div class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="legal-header">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: 1 July 2025</p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-body">
            <p>
                Nelson Mandela Bay Haematology Diagnostic Laboratories (NMBHDL) respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our web-based Laboratory Test Request Management System (NMB-HLabSys).
            </p>

            <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>We may collect the following types of information:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Personal Identifiers:</strong> Name, surname, South African ID number, email address, phone number, date of birth, and home address.</li>
                <li><strong>Health Information:</strong> Medical conditions, allergies, current medications, test requests, test results, and clinical notes.</li>
                <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, operating system, pages visited, and interaction with our system.</li>
                <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We use cookies to enhance your experience and analyze site traffic. See our <a href="@Url.Action("CookiePolicy", "Home")">Cookie Policy</a> for details.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>We use your information to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Process and manage test requests, sample tracking, and results reporting.</li>
                <li>Facilitate communication between doctors, technicians, and patients.</li>
                <li>Improve our services, system performance, and user experience.</li>
                <li>Send notifications (e.g., test completion, abnormal results, consent requests).</li>
                <li>Comply with legal and regulatory obligations.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>3. Sharing of Information</h2>
            <p>
                We do not sell or rent your personal information. We may share your data with:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Healthcare Providers:</strong> Doctors, lab technicians, and other medical professionals involved in your care.</li>
                <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Third-party vendors that assist with hosting, email delivery, and analytics (they are contractually obligated to protect your data).</li>
                <li><strong>Legal Authorities:</strong> When required by law or to protect the rights, property, or safety of NMBHDL, our users, or others.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
            <p>
                We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to safeguard your personal information, including encryption, access controls, and regular security audits. However, no system is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute protection.
            </p>

            <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
            <p>Under South African law (POPIA) and GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Access your personal information.</li>
                <li>Request correction of inaccurate data.</li>
                <li>Object to processing or request deletion of your data (subject to legal retention requirements).</li>
                <li>Withdraw consent at any time.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@nmblab.co.za">privacy@nmblab.co.za</a>.</p>

            <h2>6. Retention</h2>
            <p>
                We retain personal information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy, comply with legal obligations, and resolve disputes. Health records are typically retained for a minimum of 6 years (as required by South African medical regulations).
            </p>

            <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>
                We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes by posting a notice on our website or sending an email notification.
            </p>

            <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
                If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact our Data Protection Officer at:<br>
                <strong>Email:</strong> privacy@nmblab.co.za<br>
                <strong>Phone:</strong> +27 41 123 4567<br>
                <strong>Address:</strong> 123 Haematology Lane, Gqeberha, 6001
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>